      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F Tinker is discarding down to hand size and chose to discard a basic Mountain over Dormant Volcano. They already have 5 Mountains plus Phyrexia's Core on the battlefield. Dormant Volcano enters tapped and requires bouncing an untapped Mountain, making it a slower and more awkward land. A basic Mountain is strictly more useful as a future land drop since it enters untapped with no drawback. Word of Seizing is a powerful instant that should definitely be kept.",
