      "decision_index": 422,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Philo activated Mosswort Bridge's hideaway ability requiring total creature power 10+, but only controls Dragonspeaker Shaman (2/2) for a total power of 2. The condition cannot be met, so the exiled card cannot be played. This wastes {G} mana and taps Mosswort Bridge for no benefit.",
      "action_taken": "Activated Mosswort Bridge's hideaway ability with only 2 total creature power on board.",
