    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Kindred Summons with only Dragonspeaker Shaman on the battlefield means X=1 at best (naming Human, Barbarian, or Shaman). Spending 7 mana to find a single creature from the library is extremely poor value for this card, which is designed to be cast with many creatures of the same type in play for a massive payoff.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Kindred Summons with only 1 creature on the battlefield, getting at most 1 creature for 7 mana.",
      "better_line": "Cast Gratuitous Violence to set up future damage doubling, or use Bag of Tricks activation to build board presence first. Save Kindred Summons for when multiple Dragons or other shared creature types are on the battlefield to maximize its effect.",
      "type": "blunder",
