      "decision_index": 440,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Kindred Summons was cast with only Dragonspeaker Shaman (Human Barbarian Shaman) on the battlefield. None of the available creature type choices match any creature GLM47 controls, meaning X = 0 and the spell will find zero creatures regardless of the type chosen. A 7-mana spell is completely wasted.",
      "action_taken": "Resolving Kindred Summons with no matching creatures on the battlefield, making any type choice produce zero results.",
      "better_line": "Should not have cast Kindred Summons at all without creatures of a relevant type on the battlefield. The mana could have been used for other spells, or Kindred Summons saved for when Vrondiss or Dragon tokens were in play to choose 'Dragon.'",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 283,
