      "decision_index": 440,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Philo is attacking with Dragonspeaker Shaman (a 2/2) into Gem3F Tinker who has 62 life and a Wurmcoil Engine (6/6 with lifelink and deathtouch) on the battlefield. Meanwhile, GPT5n Drama is at 12 life with no creatures to block. Attacking GPT5n Drama would deal 2 damage to a player at 12 life, which is much more meaningful pressure than 2 damage against someone at 62 life. The 2 damage into 62 life is essentially irrelevant, while 2 into 12 represents real progress toward eliminating a player.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked Gem3F Tinker (62 life) with Dragonspeaker Shaman",
      "better_line": "Attack GPT5n Drama (12 life) to apply meaningful pressure toward eliminating a vulnerable opponent",
      "type": "blunder",
