      "decision_index": 440,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Philo is attacking with Dragonspeaker Shaman (a 2/2) into Gem3F Tinker who has 62 life and a Wurmcoil Engine (6/6 lifelink deathtouch) on board. Meanwhile, GPT5n Drama is at 12 life with no creatures to block. Attacking GPT5n Drama would put meaningful pressure on the lowest-life opponent (12 HP) and potentially threaten to eliminate them soon, whereas 2 damage to someone at 62 life is virtually meaningless.",
