    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GPT5n Drama is at 12 life with no creatures to block. Attacking with only Opportunistic Dragon (4 damage) instead of also sending Dragonspeaker Shaman (2/2) leaves 2 free damage on the table. The Shaman has minimal defensive value as a 2/2 and there's no reason to hold it back.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with only Opportunistic Dragon",
