      "player": "GLM47 Philo",
      "decision_index": 440,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Philo attacked Gem3F Tinker (at 62 life) with Dragonspeaker Shaman (a 2/2) instead of GPT5n Drama (at 12 life). Attacking Drama brings them closer to elimination (10 life), while 2 damage against 62 life is negligible. Gem3F Tinker also has Wurmcoil Engine on board, which is a much more threatening board state, but the 2 damage to 62 life accomplishes essentially nothing. Drama at 12 is much more vulnerable and closer to lethal range.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked Gem3F Tinker (62 life) with Dragonspeaker Shaman (2/2)",
