    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "GLM47 Philo activated Mosswort Bridge's hideaway ability requiring total creature power 10+, but only controls Dragonspeaker Shaman (2/2) for a total power of 2. The condition cannot be met, so the activation wastes the {G} cost and the land's tap for the turn.",
      "action_taken": "Activated Mosswort Bridge's hideaway ability with only 2 total creature power (needs 10+).",
      "better_line": "Tap Mosswort Bridge for {G} mana instead, using it productively (e.g., toward casting Gratuitous Violence or holding it for future use).",
      "type": "blunder",
