      "decision_index": 491,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Gratuitous Violence before playing Forest from hand. Should always play land first to maximize available mana. Additionally, with only Dragonspeaker Shaman on board, Gratuitous Violence provides minimal immediate value compared to developing the board with Gruul Signet for ramp.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Gratuitous Violence without first playing the Forest in hand",
      "better_line": "Play Forest first, then cast Gruul Signet to ramp toward casting Vrondiss or other impactful spells. Gratuitous Violence could wait until there are meaningful creatures to benefit from it.",
