    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 11 HP with no cards in hand, attacking with all creatures leaves no blockers against Gem3F Tinker's untapped Wurmcoil Engine (6/6 deathtouch/lifelink). Next turn, Wurmcoil can attack for 6 unblocked, dropping Drama to 5 while Tinker gains 6 life - a 12-point swing.",
      "action_taken": "Attacked with all creatures (Jor Kadeen, Chief Engineer, Sphinx Summoner, Solemn Simulacrum), leaving no blockers.",
      "better_line": "Hold back Solemn Simulacrum (or Chief Engineer) as a chump blocker for Wurmcoil Engine. This preserves Metalcraft (still 3+ artifacts), saves 6 damage, and denies Tinker 6 life. The lost 5 damage on offense is far less important than the defensive value at 11 HP.",
