    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem3F Tinker has Wurmcoil Engine (6/6) and Solemn Simulacrum (2/2) with no opposing creatures on the battlefield and all opponents' permanents tapped. Attacking with only Solemn Simulacrum leaves 6 damage (plus lifelink) on the table for no reason. GPT5n Drama is at 11hp - attacking with everything would deal 8 and put them at 3, very close to lethal next turn.",
