      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Stealing Gratuitous Violence gives Wurmcoil Engine double damage (12) but GLM47 Philo still has multiple blockers (Tuktuk the Returned, Beetleback Chief, Vrondiss, Taurean Mauler, Goblin tokens) who can block it. Stealing a large creature instead would both remove a blocker and add an attacker, potentially enabling lethal through combat. Stealing Gratuitous Violence does have defensive value (preventing GLM47's creatures from dealing double damage) but the offensive payoff is limited when the opponent can just block.",
